            <title>[IGNITE-4264] Offheap cache entries statistics is broken in master</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4264</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproducer is attached. Test is fine on 1.7 release branch, but fails in master&lt;/p&gt;

